## 1. riscv-tests, in asm/compliance/hex/

The 63 compliance programs there (the .hex files and their .tohost address
files) are compiled artefacts of the riscv-tests suite, upstream at
https://github.com/riscv-software-src/riscv-tests

They are committed in built form so this repository can be cloned and its
battery run without a RISC-V cross-toolchain present.
asm/compliance/run_compliance_ooo.sh records which upstream tests are excluded
and why. The upstream licence follows in full, and applies to those artefacts
unchanged.

