## 2. Spike (riscv-isa-sim)

tb/uvm/ref/spike_dpi.cc is original code that links against Spike's libriscv at
build time. Spike is cloned into the container by the Dockerfile and is not
redistributed here.

## 3. Accellera UVM

The UVM class library is downloaded and built inside the container image. It is
not redistributed here.
